NativeSupporterVault::activateExceptionalSettlement
├── Given canonical valuation is available (including successful zero value)
│   └── It cannot select a hidden manual fallback
├── Given unauthorized caller, wrong state, unsupported budget or underfunding
│   └── It rejects even when valuation fails
└── Given explicit Safe exception and published independent classification
    └── It uses fixed tagged token budgets, emits exceptional mode and never nets buckets
